    {
      "id": "archivist-vonn",
      "name": "Vonn Dustmere",
      "species": "Human",
      "gender": "Male",
      "age": 63,
      "occupation": "Library Archivist",
      "category": "scholars",
      "tags": [
        "library",
        "catalog",
        "dust"
      ],
      "description": "Vonn holds down a town library stack with callused competence and open ears.",
      "biography": "Walk into a town library stack and you will find Vonn Dustmere before you find a free chair. A 63-year-old Human library archivist, Vonn greets trouble the way other folk greet weather: with a coat and a plan. He dusts spines like soothing animals. The catalog cards in three conflicting systems travels with him almost everywhere. Works near Vela's rare shelf; aids Olda. His ambition is to finish a single coherent index before he dies. His nightmare is damp destroying the flood-year records. Right now, Found a missing chronicle volume returned with mill chalk on the cover.",
      "personality": "Warm with regulars, curt with wasters; dusts spines like soothing animals.",
      "motivation": "Secure enough ground to finish a single coherent index before he dies.",
      "secret": "Quietly arranging matters around this problem: Found a missing chronicle volume returned with mill chalk on the cover.",
      "rumor": "Someone paid Vonn to forget a name connected to recent trouble near a town library stack.",
