      "description": "Essa holds down a tutoring room with callused competence and open ears.",
      "biography": "Some locals swear Essa was born mid-shift at a tutoring room; the truth is only slightly less devoted. This half-elf children's tutor, now 36, treats competence like courtesy. She turns chores into lessons, never far from the slate of multiplication dragons. Tutors Perrin; friend to Hala. Ask what she wants and she names it plainly: teach commoner children beside noble ones. Ask what she dreads and the answer is Perrin learning only pride. Then comes the fresh problem—Caught Perrin forging a practice excuse in her handwriting.",
